Define language: mnemonic template language 1
	Alias: mtl-1

	Goal:
		This language will express statements and inline expressions.




	Define tokenizer: tokenizer

		waterfall token table:
			name					type		symbol
			----					------		------
			left_wrapper			literal		«
			right_wrapper						»
			escaped_left_wrapper				\«
			escaped_right_wrapper				\»
			text					default